<BaseLayout title="ILEAP — Identity & Lifestyle Evaluation & Alignment Pathway">
  <h1>ILEAP — Identity & Lifestyle Evaluation & Alignment Pathway</h1>

  <p>
    ILEAP is our flagship identity development pathway. It is structured,
    reflective, and designed to help you understand your past, appreciate your
    present, define your future, and continuously calibrate your life as you
    grow.
  </p>

  <h2>Understand Your Past</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>What stands out as consistent or enduring?</li>
    <li>What memories feel “safe” or “like home”?</li>
    <li>What memories feel jarring or persistent?</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Appreciate Your Present</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Which parts of your life today fall into those categories?</li>
    <li>What stands out about them?</li>
    <li>What falls into neither category?</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Define Your Future</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Start / Stop / Continue</li>
    <li>Keep / Increase / Introduce / Reduce / Eradicate</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Continuous Calibration</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Trial period as changes are implemented</li>
    <li>Plan for check-ins and follow-up sessions</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
